"Cold Dark": {
  "index": 0,
  "category": "rituals",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Ritual of the Cold Dark"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "This ritual calls out to the legions of the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Undead",
          "color": "dark_gray"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nBy doing so, I am offering to align myself with the undead in exchange for access to their dark powers.\n\nIf the undead respond, they will "
        },
        {
          "text": "give me a sign",
          "color": "dark_gray"
        },
        {
          "text": ". I should follow the instructions if I believe I am worthy.\n\nAllying oneself with such entities will almost assuredly make enemies of others.\n\nAlternatively, performing this ritual in a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Cathedral Great Hall",
          "color": "dark_gray"
        },
        {
          "text": " will challenge a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Powerful Undead Monster",
          "color": "dark_gray"
        },
        {
          "text": " to a duel."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "WARNING: The undead faction is a much more difficult faction to play.",
          "italic": true,
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Your casting resource becomes souls, something that does not naturally regenerate. ",
          "italic": true
        },
        {
          "text": "You must kill others to obtain their souls.",
          "italic": true,
          "color": "dark_gray"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n\n\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Other undead give the least, then animals, then monsters, then villagers, then players.",
          "italic": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\n\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "They can sleep in coffins as if they were beds and in doing so will regain 25% of souls, will ",
          "italic": true
        },
        {
          "text": "burn in sunlight",
          "italic": true,
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ", but can ",
          "italic": true
        },
        {
          "text": "breathe underwater",
          "italic": true,
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". Wearing a helmet can mitigate the burning but eventually the helmet will burn away and break.",
          "italic": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\n\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Choose this path at your own risk.",
          "italic": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": [
    {
      "type": "ritual",
      "location": "mna:rituals/cold_dark"
    }
  ]
}